{"seq":2,"slug":"decision-consistency-precedent","title":"裁决一致性与判例库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-online-dispute-resolution/appeal-consistency/decision-consistency-precedent","wordCount":2149,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"裁决一致性与判例库\">裁决一致性与判例库</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一致性（consistency）在争议系统里有精确的含义，且它不等于&quot;正确&quot;。它的定义是：<strong>相似案件应得到相似结果，差异必须可归因于可解释的变量</strong>。一个系统完全可以做到一致地错——如果全平台对所有 INR 案件都判买家胜诉，那是高度一致的，但显然不合理。因此一致性是必要而非充分条件，它保证的是<strong>可预期性</strong>，而可预期性正是当事人愿意使用平台裁决而非直接起诉的理由。</p>\n<p>当裁决量达到每天数万件时，不一致的主要来源不是个别裁决员的失职，而是三类结构性漂移：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>执行漂移</strong>：同一规则被不同裁决员以不同严格度执行，尤其在证据&quot;看起来差不多&quot;的灰色地带。</li>\n<li><strong>时间漂移</strong>：规则更新后，新旧案件适用了不同版本；或者规则没变但裁决员的经验分布变了。</li>\n<li><strong>市场漂移</strong>：不同市场的本地团队基于当地习惯发展出不同判法，跨境卖家因此面对不一致的义务。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判例库的作用是把&quot;相似案件&quot;这个模糊概念变成<strong>可检索、可度量、可引用</strong>的对象，让上述三类漂移都能被观测和收敛。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[新案件] --&gt; B[特征抽取&lt;br/&gt;类型/金额/市场/证据模式]&#10;  B --&gt; C[判例库相似检索]&#10;  C --&gt; D{存在高相似判例?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[比对: 结论是否一致?]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[正常裁决&lt;br/&gt;并回写为新判例]&#10;  E --&gt;|一致| G[引用判例&lt;br/&gt;加速裁决]&#10;  E --&gt;|不一致| H[必须显式说明&lt;br/&gt;偏离理由]&#10;  H --&gt; I[偏离理由进入&lt;br/&gt;一致性审计队列]&#10;  G --&gt; J[结案]&#10;  F --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; K{偏离是否成立?}&#10;  K --&gt;|是| L[新判例覆盖&lt;br/&gt;旧判例降权]&#10;  K --&gt;|否| M[判定为执行漂移&lt;br/&gt;回训裁决员/调规则]\">flowchart TD\n  A[新案件] --&gt; B[特征抽取&lt;br/&gt;类型/金额/市场/证据模式]\n  B --&gt; C[判例库相似检索]\n  C --&gt; D{存在高相似判例?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[比对: 结论是否一致?]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[正常裁决&lt;br/&gt;并回写为新判例]\n  E --&gt;|一致| G[引用判例&lt;br/&gt;加速裁决]\n  E --&gt;|不一致| H[必须显式说明&lt;br/&gt;偏离理由]\n  H --&gt; I[偏离理由进入&lt;br/&gt;一致性审计队列]\n  G --&gt; J[结案]\n  F --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; K{偏离是否成立?}\n  K --&gt;|是| L[新判例覆盖&lt;br/&gt;旧判例降权]\n  K --&gt;|否| M[判定为执行漂移&lt;br/&gt;回训裁决员/调规则]</pre><h2 id=\"案件特征向量\">案件特征向量</h2><p>要检索&quot;相似案件&quot;，先要定义相似。裁决一致性的相似度由四个维度构成，权重不同：</p>\n<h3 id=\"四个维度的约束强度\">四个维度的约束强度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>取值示例</th>\n<th>对相似度的作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>争议类型</td>\n<td>INR / SNAD / QUALITY</td>\n<td>硬约束：不同类型不互为判例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据模式</td>\n<td>有可核验签收 / 无签收 / 签收地址不匹配</td>\n<td>强约束：决定事实认定走向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额段</td>\n<td>分桶（如 &lt;20 / 20–100 / 100–500 / &gt;500）</td>\n<td>中约束：影响出口选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场与类目</td>\n<td>market_code + category</td>\n<td>弱约束：影响适用的政策例外</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么证据模式必须独立成维\">为什么证据模式必须独立成维</h3><p>关键在于<strong>证据模式必须作为一个显式维度</strong>，而不能只用类型。同为 INR，有签收凭证和没有签收凭证是完全不同的两类案件，判法理应不同。把类型当作唯一的分类键，会制造出大量&quot;看起来相似但判决不同&quot;的假告警，最终让一致性监控失去公信力。它会以两种方式污染指标：一是把不同类型的案件混算，二是掩盖住真正的分歧组。</p>\n<h3 id=\"金额段的分桶依据\">金额段的分桶依据</h3><p>金额段的中等权重来自它对出口选择的影响：同样的责任认定，在小额案件里可能直接全额退款（因为退货不经济），在大额案件里则应走退货退款。因此&quot;同一特征组&quot;必须包含金额段，否则小额与大额案件会被错误地要求一致。分桶应遵循 <a href=\"../evidence-adjudication/decision-tree-refund-return-compensate\">退款/退货/补偿/打款决定树</a> 的出口切换点，而不是等距切分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 判例库：每条记录是一次已结案且经过质检确认的裁决&#10;CREATE TABLE adjudication_precedent (&#10;  precedent_id     BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_id          BIGINT      NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  dispute_type     VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_pattern VARCHAR(48) NOT NULL,  -- 例: DELIVERED_SIGNED_ADDR_MATCH&#10;  amount_bucket    SMALLINT    NOT NULL,&#10;  market_code      VARCHAR(8)  NOT NULL,&#10;  category_id      BIGINT,&#10;  outcome          VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,&#10;  reason_code      VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_version     VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  quality_state    VARCHAR(12) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;VERIFIED&#39;, -- VERIFIED|OVERBROKEN&#10;  decided_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  superseded_by    BIGINT                  -- 被后续判例覆盖时指向新判例&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 一致性度量：同一特征组内的结论分歧&#10;SELECT p.dispute_type,&#10;       p.evidence_pattern,&#10;       p.amount_bucket,&#10;       count(DISTINCT p.outcome)      AS distinct_outcomes,&#10;       count(*)                       AS cases,&#10;       round(100.0 * (&#10;         SELECT count(*) FROM adjudication_precedent q&#10;         WHERE q.dispute_type = p.dispute_type&#10;           AND q.evidence_pattern = p.evidence_pattern&#10;           AND q.amount_bucket = p.amount_bucket&#10;           AND q.outcome = mode() WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY p.outcome)&#10;       ) / count(*), 2)               AS dominant_share_pct&#10;FROM adjudication_precedent p&#10;WHERE p.decided_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;  AND p.quality_state = &#39;VERIFIED&#39;&#10;GROUP BY 1, 2, 3&#10;HAVING count(*) &gt;= 30&#10;ORDER BY dominant_share_pct ASC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 判例库：每条记录是一次已结案且经过质检确认的裁决</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> adjudication_precedent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  precedent_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dispute_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_pattern </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 例: DELIVERED_SIGNED_ADDR_MATCH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_bucket    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outcome          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quality_state    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'VERIFIED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- VERIFIED|OVERBROKEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  superseded_by    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  -- 被后续判例覆盖时指向新判例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 一致性度量：同一特征组内的结论分歧</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dispute_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence_pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_bucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distinct_outcomes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cases,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adjudication_precedent q</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dispute_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dispute_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence_pattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence_pattern</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_bucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_bucket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mode() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dominant_share_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adjudication_precedent p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">quality_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'VERIFIED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dominant_share_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>dominant_share_pct</code> 是<strong>一致性得分</strong>：某一特征组内，占比最高的那一种结论占全组的百分比。低于 85% 的组应当进入审查队列，因为这意味着同一类案件存在实质分歧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏离先例的两种性质\">偏离先例的两种性质</h2><h3 id=\"正当偏离-先例本身已过时或被推翻\">正当偏离：先例本身已过时或被推翻</h3><p>三种情形下偏离是正当的：新证据规则出台（先例按旧规则判）、新判例形成（同一特征组出现更强的共识）、或监管要求变化（某市场明确禁止某种判法）。正当偏离的处理方式是<strong>显式覆盖</strong>——把旧判例标记为 <code>superseded_by</code> 指向新判例，而不是让两条矛盾的判例并存。</p>\n<h3 id=\"执行漂移-同一规则下的随意裁量\">执行漂移：同一规则下的随意裁量</h3><p>当偏离没有对应任何规则变更或新证据模式时，它就是执行漂移。这类偏离必须被系统捕获，捕获方式是<strong>要求偏离必须填写偏离理由码</strong>，而理由码是受控枚举：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"RULE_VERSION_CHANGED     规则版本变更（正当）&#10;PRECEDENT_SUPERSEDED     先例已被新判例覆盖（正当）&#10;NEW_EVIDENCE_PATTERN     证据模式超出已有判例覆盖范围（正当）&#10;MARKET_REGULATION_CHANGE 市场法规变化（正当）&#10;REVIEWER_DISCRETION      裁决员裁量（需审查）&#10;EVIDENCE_QUALITY_EXCEPTION 证据质量例外（需审查）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>RULE_VERSION_CHANGED     规则版本变更（正当）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PRECEDENT_SUPERSEDED     先例已被新判例覆盖（正当）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>NEW_EVIDENCE_PATTERN     证据模式超出已有判例覆盖范围（正当）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MARKET_REGULATION_CHANGE 市场法规变化（正当）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>REVIEWER_DISCRETION      裁决员裁量（需审查）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EVIDENCE_QUALITY_EXCEPTION 证据质量例外（需审查）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>前四个是正当理由，后两个会进入审查队列。这个设计的价值在于<strong>把&quot;说不清为什么这么判&quot;变成一种可统计的事件</strong>。若 <code>REVIEWER_DISCRETION</code> 在某个团队或某个时段集中出现，那通常是培训或规则清晰度的问题，而不是个体问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性与正确性的交叉度量\">一致性与正确性的交叉度量</h2><p>一致性指标单独看会误导：一个系统可以通过放宽所有阈值来获得高一致性。因此必须与正确性指标交叉观察，而正确性的代理指标是<strong>申诉改判率</strong>（见 <a href=\"buyer-seller-appeal-bilateral\">买卖双方双向申诉流程</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一致性（dominant share）</th>\n<th>改判率</th>\n<th>诊断</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>健康</td>\n<td>维持，继续抽样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>一致地错</td>\n<td>问题在规则本身，需修订决定树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>结果趋同但过程分歧</td>\n<td>规则表述含糊，需细化证据模式定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>双重问题</td>\n<td>优先查规则，再查执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;高一致性 + 高改判率&quot;是最危险也最难发现的组合——从指标看系统很稳定，从申诉看又不断被推翻。这类情况几乎总是意味着<strong>决定树里有一个系统性错误</strong>，而所有裁决员都在一致地应用它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判例库的维护成本与边界\">判例库的维护成本与边界</h2><p>判例库不是越大越好。三个具体的维护约束：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，判例必须经过质检确认才能入库。</strong> 把未经复核的裁决直接当判例，会让错误在系统中自我强化——后一个案子引用前一个错误的案子，形成错误的复利。<code>quality_state</code> 字段的作用就是隔离这一层。这与质量管理领域的通行做法一致：ISO 10003 为组织外部的争议解决提供了指南，其思路建立在过程的可追溯与持续改进之上，前提正是&quot;被沉淀的案例已经过确认&quot;，而非&quot;所有发生过的案例都算数&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，判例需要过期机制。</strong> 商业环境与规则都会变，三年前的判例在今天可能已不适用。可按类型设不同的有效期（机械类如 LATE 可以较长，主观类如 SNAD 应较短），过期后降权而非删除。过期的处理应当像时间戳令牌中的精度概念一样显式：RFC 3161 定义的时间戳令牌允许携带一个 <code>Accuracy</code> 字段（seconds / millis / micros），用于给出令牌所称时刻的上下界，而不是声称绝对精确（<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3161\">RFC 3161, Time-Stamp Protocol</a>）。判例的有效期同理——判例的价值应当带一个&quot;适用时间窗&quot;，而不是被默认为永久有效。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，判例库不能替代推理。</strong> 它的正确用法是<strong>加速一致案件的裁决并提供可解释的先例引用</strong>，而不是&quot;匹配到判例就直接复制结论&quot;。当新案件与判例高度相似但有细微差异时，差异本身才是裁决的重点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def adjudicate_with_precedent(case, precedents, min_similarity=0.85):&#10;    matches = [p for p in precedents&#10;               if p.evidence_pattern == case.evidence_pattern&#10;               and p.amount_bucket == case.amount_bucket]&#10;    strong = [p for p in matches if p.similarity &gt;= min_similarity]&#10;    if not strong:&#10;        return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;NORMAL_ADJUDICATION&quot;, &quot;writeback&quot;: True}&#10;    outcomes = {p.outcome for p in strong}&#10;    if len(outcomes) == 1:&#10;        return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;PRECEDENT_CITED&quot;, &quot;outcome&quot;: outcomes.pop()}&#10;    return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;DEVIATION_REQUIRED&quot;,&#10;            &quot;precedent_outcomes&quot;: sorted(outcomes),&#10;            &quot;deviation_reason_code&quot;: REQUIRED}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> adjudicate_with_precedent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(case, precedents, min_similarity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    matches </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> precedents</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.evidence_pattern </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case.evidence_pattern</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.amount_bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case.amount_bucket]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    strong </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matches </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.similarity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_similarity]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strong:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NORMAL_ADJUDICATION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"writeback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    outcomes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {p.outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strong}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(outcomes) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PRECEDENT_CITED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: outcomes.pop()}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DEVIATION_REQUIRED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"precedent_outcomes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(outcomes),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"deviation_reason_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>DEVIATION_REQUIRED</code> 是这段逻辑中最重要的分支：当同一特征组内存在多种判例结论时，系统<strong>不允许静默选择其中一种</strong>，必须要求填写偏离理由码。这个约束把&quot;无意识的漂移&quot;转化为&quot;有记录的决策&quot;，是整节的核心机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一致性 = 相似案件相似结果 + 差异可归因；它保证可预期性，但不保证正确性，必须与改判率交叉观察。</li>\n<li>漂移有三类：执行漂移（灰色地带裁量）、时间漂移（规则版本混用）、市场漂移（本地习惯分化）。</li>\n<li>相似度以四个维度定义：类型（硬约束）、证据模式（强约束）、金额段（中约束）、市场与类目（弱约束）；证据模式必须是显式维度，只用类型会制造假告警。</li>\n<li><code>dominant_share_pct</code> &lt; 85% 的特征组应进入一致性审查队列。</li>\n<li>偏离先例必须填写受控理由码；正当理由（规则变更、先例覆盖、新证据模式、法规变化）与需审查理由（裁量、证据质量例外）分离。</li>\n<li>&quot;高一致性 + 高改判率&quot;是最危险的组合，几乎总意味着决定树存在系统性错误，参见 <a href=\"../evidence-adjudication/decision-tree-refund-return-compensate\">退款/退货/补偿/打款决定树</a>。</li>\n<li>判例须经质检确认才入库并设过期机制；匹配到判例不等于复制结论，多结论并存时必须显式记录偏离理由。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"裁决一致性与判例库","id":"裁决一致性与判例库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"案件特征向量","id":"案件特征向量"},{"level":3,"text":"四个维度的约束强度","id":"四个维度的约束强度"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么证据模式必须独立成维","id":"为什么证据模式必须独立成维"},{"level":3,"text":"金额段的分桶依据","id":"金额段的分桶依据"},{"level":2,"text":"偏离先例的两种性质","id":"偏离先例的两种性质"},{"level":3,"text":"正当偏离：先例本身已过时或被推翻","id":"正当偏离-先例本身已过时或被推翻"},{"level":3,"text":"执行漂移：同一规则下的随意裁量","id":"执行漂移-同一规则下的随意裁量"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性与正确性的交叉度量","id":"一致性与正确性的交叉度量"},{"level":2,"text":"判例库的维护成本与边界","id":"判例库的维护成本与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"买卖双方双向申诉流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-online-dispute-resolution/appeal-consistency/buyer-seller-appeal-bilateral"},"next":{"title":"平台中立性与责任边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-online-dispute-resolution/appeal-consistency/platform-neutral-liability-boundary"}}